<node id="Transformer_model_architecture_figure_1_encoder_decoder_stacks (image)">
  <data key="d0">Transformer_model_architecture_figure_1_encoder_decoder_stacks (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">Schematic of the Transformer architecture showing the left encoder stack and right decoder stack. Input and output embeddings (with positional encodings) feed into N repeated layers containing Multi-Head Attention, Add &amp; Norm, and Feed Forward blocks; the decoder includes Masked Multi-Head Attention and encoder-decoder attention. Residual connections, final Linear projection, and Softmax to produce output probabilities are illustrated, matching the surrounding text describing the Transformer encoder-decoder design.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6f17b3466af9f0695eb39bbe1a4a01ee</data>
  <data key="d4">attention.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1763840653</data>
</node>
