</node>
<node id="Multi-Head Attention Mechanism (equation)">
  <data key="d0">Multi-Head Attention Mechanism (equation)</data>
  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">This equation defines the Multi-Head Attention mechanism in Transformer models, enabling the model to jointly attend to information from different representation subspaces, enhancing its ability to process sequences effectively.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54b12a7b3f93c382252cd87665da3920</data>
  <data key="d4">attention.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1763840653</data>
</node>
<node id="Feed-Forward Neural Network Layer (equation)">
  <data key="d0">Feed-Forward Neural Network Layer (equation)</data>
  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">This equation defines a feed-forward neural network layer, crucial for processing inputs in the Transformer model. It combines linear transformations and non-linear activations to learn complex mappings, enhancing the model's ability to capture intricate patterns in data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4843f4e340f36e5af43f59b4cde44908</data>
  <data key="d4">attention.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1763840653</data>
</node>
