<node id="Learning Rate Adjustment Equation (equation)">
  <data key="d0">Learning Rate Adjustment Equation (equation)</data>
  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">This equation defines the learning rate for training transformer models, balancing model size and training progress to optimize convergence and performance.</data>
